## English

### What is this?

**Transparency Map** is a real-time algorithmic monitoring platform for the Argentine State. It centralizes **11 independent monitors** covering all three branches of government — Executive, Legislative, and Judicial — plus a composite Institutional Risk Index (IRI) and the Budget Adjustment Monitor (MAP), specifically designed to detect corruption patterns, inflation erosion, and real spending cuts in public data.

The project is open source, academic, and non-profit. All data comes from official Argentine government sources (JGM, COMPR.AR, BORA, Judiciary Council, Open Budget — Ministry of Economy).

### The Institutional Risk Index (IRI)

The IRI is the platform's methodological core. It is a composite score aggregating four dimensions of institutional risk:

| Dimension | Weight | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Financial Risk | 35% | Anomalies in budget execution and payment flows |
| Procurement Risk | 30% | Irregularities in public tenders and contracts (XAI) |
| Operational Risk | 20% | Absenteeism, productivity, and institutional performance |
| Data Risk | 15% | Quality, completeness, and timeliness of public information |

The Procurement Risk component uses **XAI (Explainable AI)** to identify irregular patterns in COMPR.AR and BORA data, making every alert interpretable and auditable.

### The sites, organised in layers

The ecosystem has **12 sites** arranged in layers by how close they are to the original data. Full details, the connections between sites and a profile of each in the **[Manual](https://mapa.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar/en/manual)** and the **[relationship graph](https://mapa.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar/grafo?lang=en)**.

| Layer | Site | What it does | Primary source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Portal | [Mapa](https://mapa.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar/en) | Integrates every site, live status, daily cross-validation | The sites themselves |
| 1 · Procurement & Executive | [Comprar](https://comprar.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Contracts v1: BORA awards cross-checked with COMPR.AR and TGN | BORA · COMPR.AR · TGN |
| 1 · Procurement & Executive | [Contratos](https://contratos.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Contracts v2: XAI risk by agency and supplier | BORA · COMPR.AR · TGN |
| 1 · Procurement & Executive | [Jefatura](https://jefatura.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Executive monitor: JGM · SGP · Presidency, roster and alerts | Mapa del Estado · COMPR.AR · BORA |
| 2 · Cross-cutting analysis | [IRI Monitor](https://monitor.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Institutional Risk Index per agency | Judiciary · Deputies · Senators · COMPR.AR |
| 2 · Cross-cutting analysis | [MEACI](https://meaci.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Companies sanctioned in international corruption cases | OECD · DOJ · SFO · PNF |
| 2 · Cross-cutting analysis | [Ajuste](https://ajuste.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Budget adjustment (MAP) in nominal, real and USD terms | Open Budget · MECON · BCRA · BORA |
| 3 · Assets & Judiciary | [Decla](https://decla.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Asset declarations, IVPI, conflicts of interest | Anti-Corruption Office · BCRA |
| 3 · Assets & Judiciary | [Justicia](https://justicia.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Judicial monitor: Supreme Court, Judicial Council, courts | datos.jus.gob.ar · CSJN · PJN |
| 4 · Legislative branch | [Deputies](https://legislativo.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Chamber of Deputies legislative monitor | HCDN |
| 4 · Legislative branch | [Senators](https://senadores.ecosistematransparencia.com.ar) | Senate monitor | Senate · ArgentinaDatos |
| Satellite | [Vectores](https://corrupcionestrategica-production.up.railway.app) | Foreign state influence (strategic corruption) | Cases with public sources |

### Budget Adjustment Monitor (MAP)

The MAP tracks the evolution of Argentine public spending from 2023 to 2026 across three dimensions:

- **① Nominal** — variation in current pesos
- **② Real (CPI)** — deflated by cumulative inflation (×10.53 by 2026)
- **③ Constant USD** — variation in dollars at each period's exchange rate

Coverage: Pensions, Health, Human Capital, Public Works, Security, Defense, and Public Wages. The database contains **560,249 budget line items** (fiscal years 2023–2026).

### Tech stack

- **Backend:** Python 3.13 · FastAPI · SQLAlchemy · PostgreSQL (Railway)
- **Frontend:** Vanilla HTML/JS · Chart.js
- **Data:** Open Budget (MECON) · BCRA · INDEC · BORA · COMPR.AR · Judiciary
- **Deploy:** Railway (auto-deploy from GitHub)
- **Scraping:** GitHub Actions (daily cron)

